{
  "name": "Stripe Subscription Handler",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "checkout.session.completed",
          "customer.subscription.created",
          "customer.subscription.updated",
          "customer.subscription.deleted"
        ]
      },
      "id": "stripe-trigger",
      "name": "Stripe Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stripeTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "stripeApi": {
          "id": "stripe-credentials",
          "name": "Stripe API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "checkout-completed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.type }}",
              "rightValue": "checkout.session.completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        }
      },
      "id": "is-checkout-completed",
      "name": "Is Checkout Completed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extract data from Stripe checkout.session.completed event\nconst event = $input.first().json;\nconst session = event.data?.object || {};\nconst metadata = session.metadata || {};\n\n// Get organization_id from metadata (set during checkout creation)\nconst organization_id = metadata.organization_id;\nconst tier = metadata.tier || 'non_managed';\nconst selected_model = metadata.selected_model || 'gpt-4o-mini';\n\n// Determine if provisioning is needed\nconst requires_provisioning = tier === 'enterprise';\n\n// Get customer email for notifications\nconst customer_email = session.customer_email || session.customer_details?.email;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    organization_id,\n    tier,\n    selected_model,\n    requires_provisioning,\n    customer_email,\n    stripe_customer_id: session.customer,\n    stripe_subscription_id: session.subscription,\n    amount_total: session.amount_total,\n    currency: session.currency,\n    event_type: event.type,\n    event_id: event.id\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "extract-checkout-data",
      "name": "Extract Checkout Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-org-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.organization_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "has-organization-id",
      "name": "Has Organization ID?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "schema": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "public"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "organization_llm_configs"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "tier": "={{ $json.tier }}",
            "provider_type": "={{ $json.tier === 'enterprise' ? 'byok_azure' : ($json.tier === 'professional' ? 'byok_azure' : 'shared') }}",
            "provisioning_status": "={{ $json.requires_provisioning ? 'pending' : 'active' }}"
          }
        },
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "column": "organization_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.organization_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "returnAll": true
        }
      },
      "id": "update-org-tier",
      "name": "Update Org Tier in Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [880, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "needs-provisioning",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.requires_provisioning }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "needs-provisioning",
      "name": "Needs Provisioning?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1100, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=http://document-processor:8090/models/provision/{{ $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.organization_id }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ selected_model: $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.selected_model }) }}"
      },
      "id": "trigger-provisioning",
      "name": "Trigger Azure Provisioning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [1320, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "noreply@fetchtext.io",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.customer_email }}",
        "subject": "Welcome to FetchText {{ $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.tier | capitalize }} Plan!",
        "emailType": "html",
        "html": "=<h1>Welcome to FetchText!</h1>\n<p>Thank you for subscribing to our <strong>{{ $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.tier }}</strong> plan.</p>\n\n{{ $('Extract Checkout Data').item.json.requires_provisioning ? '<p>We are now provisioning your dedicated Azure OpenAI instance. This typically takes 2-5 minutes. You will receive another email when your instance is ready.</p>' : '<p>Your account is now active and ready to use!</p>' }}\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>The FetchText Team</p>"
      },
      "id": "send-welcome-email",
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sendGrid",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1320, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "sendGridApi": {
          "id": "sendgrid-credentials",
          "name": "SendGrid API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Handle subscription update/cancellation events\nconst event = $input.first().json;\nconst subscription = event.data?.object || {};\nconst metadata = subscription.metadata || {};\n\nconst organization_id = metadata.organization_id;\nconst event_type = event.type;\n\n// Determine new tier based on event\nlet new_tier = 'free';\nlet action = 'none';\n\nif (event_type === 'customer.subscription.deleted') {\n  new_tier = 'free';\n  action = 'downgrade';\n} else if (event_type === 'customer.subscription.updated') {\n  // Check if subscription is still active\n  if (subscription.status === 'active') {\n    new_tier = metadata.tier || 'non_managed';\n    action = 'update';\n  } else if (subscription.status === 'canceled' || subscription.status === 'unpaid') {\n    new_tier = 'free';\n    action = 'downgrade';\n  }\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    organization_id,\n    new_tier,\n    action,\n    subscription_status: subscription.status,\n    event_type,\n    event_id: event.id\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "handle-subscription-change",
      "name": "Handle Subscription Change",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-downgrade",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
              "rightValue": "downgrade",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "is-downgrade",
      "name": "Is Downgrade?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "=http://document-processor:8090/models/provision/{{ $json.organization_id }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-deprovisioning",
      "name": "Trigger Deprovisioning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [880, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "schema": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "public"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "organization_llm_configs"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "tier": "free",
            "provider_type": "none",
            "provisioning_status": "inactive"
          }
        },
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "column": "organization_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.organization_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "reset-org-to-free",
      "name": "Reset Org to Free Tier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 350],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stripe Subscription Handler\n\nThis workflow handles all Stripe subscription events:\n\n1. **checkout.session.completed** - New subscription\n   - Updates org tier in Supabase\n   - Triggers Azure provisioning for Enterprise\n   - Sends welcome email\n\n2. **customer.subscription.deleted** - Cancellation\n   - Triggers deprovisioning\n   - Resets org to free tier\n\n### Required Credentials:\n- Stripe API (webhook secret)\n- Supabase API (service role key)\n- SendGrid API (for emails)\n\n### Metadata Required in Checkout:\n```json\n{\n  \"organization_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"tier\": \"enterprise\",\n  \"selected_model\": \"gpt-4o-mini\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "no-op-missing-org",
      "name": "Log Missing Org ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [880, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "no-op-complete",
      "name": "Complete (No Provisioning)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1320, 100]
    }
  ],
